{"id":"time-based-key-value-store","title":"Time Based Key-Value Store","difficulty":"Medium","pattern":"Design","tags":["Hash Table","Binary Search","Design","String"],"companies":{"google":3,"apple":2,"meta":2,"amazon":3,"microsoft":1},"kind":"design","class_name":"TimeMap","description":"Design a key-value store where every write carries a timestamp and reads ask for the value as of a given time.\n\n- `TimeMap()` creates an empty store.\n- `set(key, value, timestamp)` records that `key` had `value` at time `timestamp`.\n- `get(key, timestamp)` returns the value written to `key` with the **largest timestamp that is less than or equal to** `timestamp`. If no such write exists, return `\"\"`.\n\nFor a given key, the timestamps passed to `set` are strictly increasing.","examples":[{"input":"[\"TimeMap\",\"set\",\"get\",\"get\",\"set\",\"get\",\"get\"]\n[[],[\"foo\",\"bar\",1],[\"foo\",1],[\"foo\",3],[\"foo\",\"bar2\",4],[\"foo\",4],[\"foo\",5]]","output":"[null,null,\"bar\",\"bar\",null,\"bar2\",\"bar2\"]","explanation":"At time 3 the latest write to foo is still the one from time 1. From time 4 onwards it is bar2."},{"input":"[\"TimeMap\",\"set\",\"get\",\"get\"]\n[[],[\"a\",\"x\",5],[\"a\",4],[\"b\",5]]","output":"[null,null,\"\",\"\"]","explanation":"Nothing was written to a before time 5, and key b does not exist."}],"constraints":["1 <= key.length, value.length <= 100","key and value consist of lowercase letters and digits","1 <= timestamp <= 10^7","Timestamps for set calls on the same key are strictly increasing","At most 2 * 10^5 calls to set and get"],"hints":["Each key needs to remember its whole history, not just the latest value.","Because set timestamps are strictly increasing per key, appending to a list keeps that list sorted for free.","On get, binary search the key's timestamp list for the rightmost entry <= timestamp (bisect_right minus one)."],"starter":"class TimeMap:\n    def __init__(self):\n        pass\n\n    def set(self, key: str, value: str, timestamp: int) -> None:\n        pass\n\n    def get(self, key: str, timestamp: int) -> str:\n        pass\n","compare":"exact","tests":[{"input":{"ops":[["TimeMap",[]],["set",["foo","bar",1]],["get",["foo",1]],["get",["foo",3]],["set",["foo","bar2",4]],["get",["foo",4]],["get",["foo",5]]]},"output":[null,null,"bar","bar",null,"bar2","bar2"]},{"input":{"ops":[["TimeMap",[]],["set",["a","x",5]],["get",["a",4]],["get",["b",5]]]},"output":[null,null,"",""]},{"input":{"ops":[["TimeMap",[]],["get",["missing",1]],["set",["k","v1",10]],["set",["k","v2",20]],["set",["k","v3",30]],["get",["k",9]],["get",["k",10]],["get",["k",19]],["get",["k",25]],["get",["k",30]],["get",["k",10000000]]]},"output":[null,"",null,null,null,"","v1","v1","v2","v3","v3"]},{"input":{"ops":[["TimeMap",[]],["set",["a","1",1]],["set",["b","2",2]],["get",["a",2]],["get",["b",1]],["get",["b",2]]]},"output":[null,null,null,"1","","2"]},{"input":{"ops":[["TimeMap",[]],["set",["k","1",1]],["set",["k","3",3]],["set",["k","5",5]],["set",["k","7",7]],["set",["k","9",9]],["set",["k","11",11]],["set",["k","13",13]],["set",["k","15",15]],["set",["k","17",17]],["set",["k","19",19]],["set",["k","21",21]],["set",["k","23",23]],["set",["k","25",25]],["set",["k","27",27]],["set",["k","29",29]],["set",["k","31",31]],["set",["k","33",33]],["set",["k","35",35]],["set",["k","37",37]],["set",["k","39",39]],["set",["k","41",41]],["set",["k","43",43]],["set",["k","45",45]],["set",["k","47",47]],["set",["k","49",49]],["set",["k","51",51]],["set",["k","53",53]],["set",["k","55",55]],["set",["k","57",57]],["set",["k","59",59]],["set",["k","61",61]],["set",["k","63",63]],["set",["k","65",65]],["set",["k","67",67]],["set",["k","69",69]],["set",["k","71",71]],["set",["k","73",73]],["set",["k","75",75]],["set",["k","77",77]],["set",["k","79",79]],["set",["k","81",81]],["set",["k","83",83]],["set",["k","85",85]],["set",["k","87",87]],["set",["k","89",89]],["set",["k","91",91]],["set",["k","93",93]],["set",["k","95",95]],["set",["